---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { withBase } from "../lib/paths";
---

<Base
  title="Spatial Kata Notation"
  description="A readable notation for karate kata and bunkai, built to help students remember embusen and sequence, never to replace the sensei."
  active="home"
>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-plane" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="embusen">
        <span class="axis axis-v"></span>
        <span class="axis axis-h"></span>
        <span class="node n-c"></span>
        <span class="node n-n"></span>
        <span class="node n-s"></span>
        <span class="node n-e"></span>
        <span class="node n-w"></span>
        <span class="path path-1"></span>
        <span class="path path-2"></span>
        <span class="path path-3"></span>
        <span class="compass">N</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="container hero-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow fade-up">形 · Kata · Memory Aid</p>
      <h1 class="brand-hero fade-up">SKN</h1>
      <p class="tagline fade-up-delay">Spatial Kata Notation</p>
      <p class="hero-lead fade-up-delay">
        Write kata so you can see direction, stance, and technique in one glance,
        then return to the floor and train with respect.
      </p>
      <div class="btn-row fade-up-delay-2">
        <a class="btn" href={withBase("/guide")}>Read the guide</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href={withBase("/practice")}>Practice generator</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section respect">
    <div class="container respect-grid">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">First principle</p>
        <h2>The sensei teaches.<br />SKN only reminds.</h2>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p>
          Karate is transmitted person to person: in the dojo, under a teacher,
          through correction and repetition. This notation is a notebook for the
          <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Embusen">embusen</a> and the
          order of moves. It does not grade your form, settle style debates, or
          stand in for instruction.
        </p>
        <p>
          Use it after class to remember. Use it before practice to review. Always
          defer to your sensei when notation and teaching differ.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section why">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">The need</p>
      <h2>Kata is spatial. Notes should be too.</h2>
      <div class="why-grid">
        <article>
          <h3>Direction is half the kata</h3>
          <p>
            <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Embusen">Embusen</a>, the
            floor pattern, is easy to lose in paragraph notes. SKN keeps facing
            and movement visible in the structure itself.
          </p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <h3>Readable without software</h3>
          <p>
            Plain text. Copy into a notebook, email, or chat. No app lock-in.
            Students can read it on a phone between sets.
          </p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <h3>Same spine for bunkai</h3>
          <p>
            Applications attach to the same move tree. The kata line stays clear;
            the bunkai reading sits beside it, never above the teacher’s version.
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section preview">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">At a glance</p>
      <h2>One move, one branch.</h2>
      <pre class="notation sample">{`+-- [STEP → N] -------------- (Face: N)
|   ├─ Stance : [R] Z-D
|   ├─ Action : Right Age-uke (J)
|   └─ Key    : Rise under attack angle`}</pre>
      <div class="btn-row">
        <a class="btn" href={withBase("/examples/pinan-nidan")}>See Pinan Nidan</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href={withBase("/practice")}>Practice generator</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .hero {
    position: relative;
    min-height: min(92vh, 54rem);
    display: grid;
    align-items: end;
    padding: 2rem 0 4.5rem;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .hero-plane {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: 0;
  }

  .embusen {
    position: absolute;
    right: max(-4rem, 2vw);
    top: 8%;
    width: min(58vw, 34rem);
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    opacity: 0.9;
  }

  .axis {
    position: absolute;
    background: var(--line-strong);
  }

  .axis-v {
    left: 50%;
    top: 8%;
    bottom: 8%;
    width: 1px;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
  }

  .axis-h {
    top: 50%;
    left: 8%;
    right: 8%;
    height: 1px;
    transform: translateY(-50%);
  }

  .node {
    position: absolute;
    width: 0.7rem;
    height: 0.7rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--ink);
    background: var(--paper-lift);
    border-radius: 50%;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
  }

  .n-c {
    left: 50%;
    top: 50%;
    background: var(--seal);
    border-color: var(--seal);
    width: 0.9rem;
    height: 0.9rem;
  }

  .n-n {
    left: 50%;
    top: 12%;
  }
  .n-s {
    left: 50%;
    top: 88%;
  }
  .n-e {
    left: 88%;
    top: 50%;
  }
  .n-w {
    left: 12%;
    top: 50%;
  }

  .path {
    position: absolute;
    height: 2px;
    background: var(--seal);
    transform-origin: left center;
    opacity: 0;
    animation: drawPath 14s var(--ease) infinite both;
  }

  .path-1 {
    left: 50%;
    top: 50%;
    width: 28%;
    transform: rotate(-90deg);
    animation-delay: 0.6s;
  }

  .path-2 {
    left: 50%;
    top: 22%;
    width: 22%;
    transform: rotate(0deg);
    animation-delay: 2.1s;
  }

  .path-3 {
    left: 72%;
    top: 22%;
    width: 26%;
    transform: rotate(90deg);
    animation-delay: 3.6s;
  }

  .compass {
    position: absolute;
    left: 50%;
    top: 2%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    color: var(--ink-mute);
  }

  .hero-copy {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    max-width: 34rem;
    padding-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .brand-hero {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(4.5rem, 14vw, 8.5rem);
    line-height: 0.9;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  }

  .tagline {
    margin: 0.35rem 0 1.1rem;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 2.5vw, 1.7rem);
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }

  .hero-lead {
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 28rem;
    font-size: 1.12rem;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }

  .section {
    padding: 4.5rem 0;
  }

  .respect {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.28);
  }

  .respect-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.15fr;
    gap: 2.5rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .respect h2 {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .why-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 2rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }

  .why-grid h3 {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .preview .sample {
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }

  @keyframes drawPath {
    0% {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: rotate(var(--r, 0deg)) scaleX(0.12);
    }
    12% {
      opacity: 0.85;
      transform: rotate(var(--r, 0deg)) scaleX(1);
    }
    58% {
      opacity: 0.85;
      transform: rotate(var(--r, 0deg)) scaleX(1);
    }
    74% {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: rotate(var(--r, 0deg)) scaleX(1);
    }
    75%,
    100% {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: rotate(var(--r, 0deg)) scaleX(0.12);
    }
  }

  .path-1 {
    --r: -90deg;
  }
  .path-2 {
    --r: 0deg;
  }
  .path-3 {
    --r: 90deg;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .respect-grid,
    .why-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }

    .embusen {
      opacity: 0.35;
      width: min(90vw, 28rem);
      right: -10%;
      top: 0;
    }

    .hero {
      min-height: auto;
      padding-top: 3rem;
    }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .path {
      animation: none;
      opacity: 0.7;
    }
  }
</style>
